# `render table` keeps the data as a table; its spec has only the kind.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../data/orders.csv'
| summarize revenue = sum(amount), orders = count() by customerId
| top 3 by revenue desc
| render table
---- expected
customerId | revenue | orders
string     | real    | long
-----------+---------+-------
c-042      | 1250.5  |      7
c-007      |  980.0  |      6
c-113      |  402.25 |      4
render: table
